{"articleNo":"472723","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=472723&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [중소기업산학협력센터]2024년도 중소기업 기술개발 지원사업 통합공고 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2024.01.19","hit":"5402","attachments":[{"name":"[공고+제2024-37호]2024년+중소기업+기술개발+지원사업+통합+공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=472723&attachNo=130914"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>2024년도 중소기업 기술개발 지원사업 통합공고 안내(중소벤처기업부 공고 제2024-37호)</b><div><font face=\"돋움\"><br></font><div><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:150%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">중소기업의 신기술</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">․</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">신제품 개발 및 공정혁신 등 기술경쟁력 향상을 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 12pt;\">위해</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">중소벤처기업부에서 추진하고 있는 \"</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">년 중소기업 기술개발 지원사업\"</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">시행계획</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">을 다음과 같이 공고합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:150%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&lt;통합공고문은 붙임 자료 참조&gt;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가. 중소기업 기술개발 지원사업 통합설명회 개최</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;○ (중기부 사업설명회)</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지역별 대면 설명회</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - (대면) ’24. 1. 26. ~ 2. 5. (※13개 지역)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 지역별 세부 일정은 변경될 수 있으니 SMTECH 사이트 공지사항 참조</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; *</span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 30.(화) 14:00~16:30 대구경북지방중소벤처기업청 대강당 : R&amp;D지원사업 설명회</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- (설명자료) 지방청, 테크노파크, 창조경제혁신센터 등에서 배포 예정, 지방청 홈페이지 및 SMTECH에 PDF 설명자료 등 게재</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">○</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;(범부처 합동 설명회)</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">온·오프라인 동시 생중계를 통해 14개 부처 참여</span><br><strong></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - (일정) ‘24. 1. 24. , 세종컨벤션센터</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 중기부 13:30~14:30 진행</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나. 세부 사업별 공고는 향후 공지 예정</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;○&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청 방법은 범부처 통합연구지원 시스템(IRIS)을 통한 온라인 신청, 일부 사업에 한하여 중소기업 기술개발사업 종합관리시스템(SMTECH) 활용</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;범부처 통합 연구지원 시스템(IRIS) :</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.iris.go.kr/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(86, 86, 86); word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">www.iris.go.kr</span></a></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; -</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;중소기업 기술개발사업 종합관리시스템(SMTECH) :</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://www.smtech.go.kr/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(86, 86, 86); word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">www.smtech.go.kr</span></a></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;, Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: normal; color: rgb(86, 86, 86); font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, NanumGothicBold, &quot;Malg